<section class="rs-hero"><div class="rs-w rs-hero-g"><div class="rs-hero-t"><p class="rs-ey">A guide to the slow Italian classic</p><h1>Risotto</h1><p class="rs-lead">Rice, stock, butter and cheese, stirred with patience into something silky. Learn the method, scale the quantities and plan an easy dinner around it.</p><div class="rs-hero-a"><a class="rs-btn" href="how-to-make-risotto-guide.html">Learn the method</a><a class="rs-lnk" href="#qty">How much do I need?</a></div>
<dl class="rs-facts"><div><dt>Minutes of stirring</dt><dd><span data-count="18">0</span></dd></div><div><dt>Grams of rice each</dt><dd><span data-count="80">0</span></dd></div><div><dt>Classic stages</dt><dd><span data-count="4">0</span></dd></div></dl></div>
<div class="rs-pan"><svg class="rs-steam" viewBox="0 0 220 130" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M60 120c-14-20 14-40 0-60s14-40 0-60" style="--d:3.4s;animation-delay:-0.0s"/><path d="M110 120c-14-20 14-40 0-60s14-40 0-60" style="--d:3.9s;animation-delay:-0.9s"/><path d="M160 120c-14-20 14-40 0-60s14-40 0-60" style="--d:4.4s;animation-delay:-1.8s"/></svg><div class="rs-pan-h" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="rs-pan-o"><div class="rs-pan-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1712407881629-a8ca82a3c64f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=560&h=560&q=75" alt="golden saffron risotto in a white bowl" width="560" height="560" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="rs-swirl" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="rs-sp" viewBox="0 0 30 200" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="15" cy="26" rx="13" ry="24"/><path d="M12 48h6v148h-6z"/></svg></div></div></div></div></section>

